Text:
This design is about operations involving a single Fearless project; the location of this Fearless project is the Base16 in scope.
The 'name' of a Fearless project is ProjectName when ProjectName ".fearless" is the only file at top level in that Fearless project ending with ".fearless".
This design assumes that the modification time of a folder changes when a file or a folder is added to, removed from or renamed in that folder.
//later: a Fearless project at a path where that assumption does not hold is refused when it is registered: on Windows, FAT32 and exFAT. A later version can accept such a Fearless project by recording a hash of every input, or when the Fearless project holds only zip files at its top level.

Grammar:
FearlessPath ::= ("/" ValidSegment)*
FearlessFile ::= (FearlessPath->Content)
PackageFolder ::= "_" [a-z0-9_]*
FileNameRest ::= [a-z0-9_.]*
RankFileName ::= "_rank_" RankLevel ".fear" | "_rank_" RankLevel [0-9][0-9][0-9] ".fear"
RankLevel ::= "base" | "core" | "driver" | "worker" | "framework" | "accumulator" | "tool" | "app"
Out ::= ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
LowerJson ::= (PackageName->Content)
CompileResult ::= Out | "error(" Str ")"
OutExtension ::= ".json" | ".jar" | ".html" | ".txt" | ".unfinished"
MountedPaths ::= MountedPath1 .. MountedPathn
MountedPath ::= (TypeName->Base16)

Signature: frontend.rankFilesError(FearlessFiles) = Str//the text that says what is wrong in the rank files FearlessFiles; undefined when nothing is wrong

Signature: frontend.rank(FearlessPath) = Nat//the rank that the name of the rank file at FearlessPath gives; a smaller Nat is a lower rank

Signature: frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,FearlessFiles,Content)//holds when the maps that the rank files FearlessFiles give to PackageName are not the maps that Content, the json file of PackageName, records

Signature: frontend.compile(PackageName,FearlessFiles,FearlessFiles',LowerJsons) = CompileResult//compiles the files FearlessFiles of PackageName, with the rank files FearlessFiles' and the json files of the packages of lower rank

Signature: frontend.mains(Content1 .. Contentn) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the types that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as mains

Signature: frontend.attenuators(Content1 .. Contentn) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the types that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as attenuators

Signature: frontend.dataTypes(Content1 .. Contentn) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the types that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as needing mounted data

Signature: frontend.claims(Content1 .. Contentn,OSExtension) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the mains that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as opening the files with the extension OSExtension

Signature: fearlessProject$jsonBase = Content//the json file of the package "base", which comes with fearlessManager

Signature: fearlessProject$runMain(TypeName,Attenuator,MountedPaths,InputFile)//runs the main TypeName, with the attenuators that Attenuator gives to TypeName, with the Fearless projects of MountedPaths as mounted data, and with the file that InputFile encodes the path of as the input file; with "NoFile", the main has no input file

Define fearlessProject$checkShapeRules:
A action os$currentDesk() = Desk
B if not fearlessProject.wellShaped(Desk, Desk.deskPath(Base16.taggedText)), error fearlessProjectErrorIsNotWellShaped(Base16)
//later: the Error says one broken shape rule and the paths that break that shape rule

Define fearlessProject$checkPackages:
A action fearlessProject$fearlessFiles = FearlessFile1 .. FearlessFilen
B action fearlessProject$checkPackageOf(FearlessFile1.FearlessPath) .. fearlessProject$checkPackageOf(FearlessFilen.FearlessPath)

Define fearlessProject$checkPackageOf(FearlessPath):
A if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 "/" PackageFolder FearlessPath2 "/" PackageFolder' FearlessPath3, error fearlessProjectErrorPathIsInTwoPackages(FearlessPath)
B if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 "/" PackageFolder FearlessPath2, return fearlessProject$checkPackageFolder(PackageFolder,FearlessPath)
C if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 ".fear", error fearlessProjectErrorFearFileIsInNoPackage(FearlessPath)

Define fearlessProject$checkPackageFolder(PackageFolder,FearlessPath):
A if PackageFolder is not of form "_" PackageName, error fearlessProjectErrorPackageNameIsNotValid(FearlessPath)
B if PackageFolder is "_base" or PackageFolder is "_rank", error fearlessProjectErrorPackageNameIsReserved(FearlessPath)
C if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 "/_rank_" FileNameRest and FearlessPath is not of form FearlessPath1 "/" RankFileName, error fearlessProjectErrorRankFileNameIsNotValid(FearlessPath)
D fact PackageFolder = "_" PackageName
E action fearlessProject$rankFiles.filter(FearlessFile->FearlessFile.FearlessPath.contains("/_" PackageName "/")) = FearlessFile1 .. FearlessFilen
F if n is 0, error fearlessProjectErrorPackageHasNoRankFile(PackageName)
G if n is more than 1, error fearlessProjectErrorPackageHasManyRankFiles(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$allPaths:
A action return the set of the DeskPaths at Base16 or inside Base16

Define fearlessProject$visiblePaths:
A action return the set of the DeskPaths of fearlessProject$allPaths where no Segment after Base16 starts with "."

Define fearlessProject$fearlessFiles:
A action return the set of the FearlessFiles that Fearless code sees inside Base16, including the FearlessFiles inside zip files; a zip file is not a FearlessFile, and in the FearlessPath of a FearlessFile inside a zip file, the name of that zip file is without its ending ".zip"

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out:
A action return the set of the names of the files directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("x"->Content):
A action create the folder .fearless_out when Base16 has no folder .fearless_out
B action write the file x holding Content directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16; a file x that is there is replaced, and the file x gets a new modification time

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "x":
A action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("x"->Content), with the empty Content

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x":
A action delete the file x directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16; nothing happens when no file x is there

Define fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate(Project):
A if "compile_start.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
B if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
C if "last_compile_result.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
D if the modification time of "last_compile_result.txt" is not after the modification time of "compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
E fact Project.#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
F if the Content of the file "last_compile_result.txt" directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16 is not "Accepted " Kind, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)

Define fearlessProject$checkCanRun(Project,TypeName):
A if Project.#kind is not Infos.msg("code"), error fearlessProjectErrorIsNotOfKindCode(Base16)
B action fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate(Project)
C if TypeName is not in frontend.mains(fearlessProject$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorTypeIsNotAMain(TypeName)
D action fearlessProject$checkAttenuators(Project.#attenuators)
E action fearlessProject$checkMountedTypes(Project.#mounts)

Signature: fearlessProject$checkAttenuators(Attenuator)

Define fearlessProject$checkAttenuators(Infos.map(TypeName1, TypeNames1 .. TypeNamen, TypeNamesn)):
A if TypeNamei is not in frontend.mains(fearlessProject$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorAttenuatedMainIsNotAMain(TypeNamei)
B if Infos.msg(TypeName) in TypeNamesi and TypeName is not in frontend.attenuators(fearlessProject$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorAttenuatorIsNotAnAttenuator(TypeNamei,TypeName)

Signature: fearlessProject$checkMountedTypes(Mount)

Define fearlessProject$checkMountedTypes(Infos.map(TypeName1, Infos.msg(ProjectName1) .. TypeNamen, Infos.msg(ProjectNamen))):
A if TypeNamei is not in frontend.dataTypes(fearlessProject$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorMountedTypeIsNotADataType(TypeNamei)
B if TypeName in frontend.dataTypes(fearlessProject$jsons) and TypeName is not one of TypeName1 .. TypeNamen, error fearlessProjectErrorDataTypeIsNotMounted(TypeName)

Define fearlessProject$claims(Project,OSExtension):
A fact Project.#path = Infos.msg(Base16.taggedText)
B action return frontend.claims(fearlessProject$jsons,OSExtension)

Define fearlessProject$jsons:
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return fearlessProject$jsonBase fearlessProject$json(PackageName1) .. fearlessProject$json(PackageNamen)

Define fearlessProject$compile(Project):
A action fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate(Project) ends with done.
B fact Project.#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
C action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("last_compile_result.txt"->"Accepted " Kind)

Define fearlessProject$compile(Project):
A action fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate(Project) ends with Error.
B action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "compile_start.txt"
C action wait until the clock of the file system of Base16 is after the modification time of "compile_start.txt"
D action fearlessProject$checkShapeRules
E action fearlessProject$compileCode(Project)
F fact Project.#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
G action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("last_compile_result.txt"->"Accepted " Kind)

Define fearlessProject$compileCode(Project):
A fact Project.#kind is not Infos.msg("code").

Define fearlessProject$compileCode(Project):
A fact Project.#kind is Infos.msg("code").
B action fearlessProject$checkPackages
C if frontend.rankFilesError(fearlessProject$rankFiles) = Str, error fearlessProjectErrorRankFilesAreNotValid(Str)
D action fearlessProject$cleanup
E action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
F action fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName1) .. fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageNamen)

Define fearlessProject$cleanup:
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B if "_" PackageName OutExtension in fearlessProject$fearless_out and PackageName is not one of PackageName1 .. PackageNamen, return fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x", for each "x" in fearlessProject$fearless_out that is not "compile_start.txt" and is not "last_compile_result.txt"
C action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x", for each "x" in fearlessProject$fearless_out that is not "compile_start.txt", is not "last_compile_result.txt" and is not of form "_" PackageNamei OutExtension for an i in 1..n

Define fearlessProject$packages:
A action return each PackageName where fearlessProject$files(PackageName) is not empty, ordered by fearlessProject$rank(PackageName), then by PackageName

Define fearlessProject$lower(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return the list of "base" and of each PackageNamei where fearlessProject$rank(PackageNamei) < fearlessProject$rank(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$higher(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return the list of each PackageNamei where fearlessProject$rank(PackageNamei) > fearlessProject$rank(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$lowerJsons(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$lower(PackageName) = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return (PackageName1->fearlessProject$json(PackageName1)) .. (PackageNamen->fearlessProject$json(PackageNamen))

Signature: fearlessProject$json(PackageName) = Content

Define fearlessProject$json("base"):
A action return fearlessProject$jsonBase

Define fearlessProject$json(PackageName):
A fact PackageName is not "base"
B action return the Content of the file "_" PackageName ".json" directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16

Define fearlessProject$files(PackageName):
A action return fearlessProject$fearlessFiles.filter(FearlessFile->FearlessFile.FearlessPath.contains("/_" PackageName "/"))

Define fearlessProject$rankFiles:
A action return fearlessProject$fearlessFiles.filter(FearlessFile->FearlessFile.FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath "/" RankFileName)

Define fearlessProject$rank(PackageName):
A fact (FearlessPath "/_" PackageName FearlessPath' "/" RankFileName->Content) in fearlessProject$rankFiles
B action return frontend.rank(FearlessPath "/_" PackageName FearlessPath' "/" RankFileName)

Define fearlessProject$sharedPaths:
A action return fearlessProject$visiblePaths.filter(DeskPath->DeskPath is a folder or a zip file, and no Segment of DeskPath after Base16 is of form "_" PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName):
A if "_" PackageName ".unfinished" in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
B if "_" PackageName ".jar" or "_" PackageName ".json" is not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
C if the modification time of a DeskPath of fearlessProject$visiblePaths of form DeskPath' "_" PackageName Segment1 .. Segmentn is after the modification time of "_" PackageName ".jar", return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
D if the modification time of a DeskPath of fearlessProject$sharedPaths is after the modification time of "_" PackageName ".jar", return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
E if frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,fearlessProject$rankFiles,fearlessProject$json(PackageName)), return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$higher(PackageName) = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "_" PackageName ".unfinished"
C action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_" PackageName ".jar"
D action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_" PackageName1 ".jar" .. fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_" PackageNamen ".jar"
E fact frontend.compile(PackageName,fearlessProject$files(PackageName),fearlessProject$rankFiles,fearlessProject$lowerJsons(PackageName)) = CompileResult
F if CompileResult = "error(" Str ")", error fearlessProjectErrorPackageDoesNotCompile(PackageName,Str)
G fact CompileResult = ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
H action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".json"->Content1)
I action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".html"->Content3)
J action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".txt"->Content4)
K action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".jar"->Content2)
L action wait until the clock of the file system of Base16 is after the modification time of "_" PackageName ".jar"
M if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorFilesChangedDuringCompile(Base16)
N action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_" PackageName ".unfinished"

Implementation notes:
frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,fearlessProject$rankFiles,fearlessProject$json(PackageName)) holds also when the packages of lower rank than PackageName are not the packages that the json file of PackageName records: a package whose rank changes, or a package of lower rank that is added or removed, is a change of the maps of PackageName. Double check that the code does this.
